{"seq":3,"slug":"collusion-and-cartels","title":"合谋与卡特尔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/industrial-organization/firm-conduct/collusion-and-cartels","wordCount":2049,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"合谋与卡特尔\">合谋与卡特尔</h1><p>2025 年前后，全球多家货运、汽车零部件、内存芯片厂商仍在为多年前的价格操纵支付天价罚款。这些案件有个共同剧本：几家本应竞争的企业坐到一起（或心照不宣地）约定抬价、限产、分割市场，把本该流向消费者的好处揽入自己腰包。这就是合谋。从企业角度看，合谋是寡头格局下最诱人的选择——既能享受垄断般的高利润，又无须真正合并。但合谋有个致命的内在矛盾：每一个参与者都有偷偷背叛、降价抢市场的强烈动机。本节用博弈论解释合谋为何可能维持、又为何屡屡瓦解，以及反垄断如何利用这种内在脆弱性来瓦解卡特尔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合谋的核心是一场囚徒困境：集体利益要求大家共同维持高价，个体利益却诱使每家偷偷降价。一次性博弈中合谋必然崩溃，但现实是重复博弈，这给了惩罚背叛者的机会，使合谋有可能维持。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[寡头合谋动机] --&gt; B[共同抬价&lt;br/&gt;分享垄断利润]&#10;  B --&gt; C{囚徒困境}&#10;  C --&gt;|一次博弈| D[必然背叛&lt;br/&gt;合谋崩溃]&#10;  C --&gt;|重复博弈| E[可用未来惩罚&lt;br/&gt;约束当下背叛]&#10;  E --&gt; F{贴现因子 δ 够大?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[合谋可维持]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[背叛仍有利]&#10;  G --&gt; I[显性卡特尔 违法]&#10;  G --&gt; J[默契合谋 难举证]\">flowchart TD\n  A[寡头合谋动机] --&gt; B[共同抬价&lt;br/&gt;分享垄断利润]\n  B --&gt; C{囚徒困境}\n  C --&gt;|一次博弈| D[必然背叛&lt;br/&gt;合谋崩溃]\n  C --&gt;|重复博弈| E[可用未来惩罚&lt;br/&gt;约束当下背叛]\n  E --&gt; F{贴现因子 δ 够大?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[合谋可维持]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[背叛仍有利]\n  G --&gt; I[显性卡特尔 违法]\n  G --&gt; J[默契合谋 难举证]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对合谋稳定性的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>贴现因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对未来收益的看重程度</td>\n<td>越高越易维持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发策略</td>\n<td>一旦背叛即永久回到竞争</td>\n<td>提供惩罚威胁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业数量</td>\n<td>参与方多少</td>\n<td>越多越难维持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求波动</td>\n<td>市场需求是否稳定</td>\n<td>越不稳越难监测背叛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合谋分析最重要的洞见来自重复博弈：当企业足够看重长远（贴现因子足够大），「背叛能赚的眼前一笔」就抵不过「被报复后永远失去的合谋利润」，于是理性企业反而会自愿守约。这把上一章 <a href=\"../market-structure/oligopoly-market-power\">寡头与市场势力</a> 的静态分析推进到了动态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合谋的囚徒困境本质\">合谋的囚徒困境本质</h2><p>设两家寡头各有「维持高价」和「背叛降价」两个选择。若都维持高价，各得较高的合谋利润；若一方背叛降价，它抢走大部分市场赚得最多，守约方损失惨重；若都背叛，则陷入价格战，各得微薄的竞争利润（参见伯特兰悖论）。这个收益结构正是经典囚徒困境：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>对手维持高价</th>\n<th>对手背叛降价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>我维持高价</td>\n<td>合谋利润，合谋利润</td>\n<td>最低，最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>我背叛降价</td>\n<td>最高，最低</td>\n<td>竞争利润，竞争利润</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论对手怎么做，「背叛」都是我的占优策略——对手维持高价时我背叛能独吞市场，对手背叛时我也只能跟着背叛。结果双方都背叛，落入对集体最差的竞争均衡。这解释了一个深刻悖论：合谋对企业整体明明有利，却因个体理性而难以自发达成。一次性交易中，卡特尔注定瓦解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重复博弈与无名氏定理\">重复博弈与无名氏定理</h2><p>现实中企业年复一年地在同一市场相遇，这是无限重复博弈。重复改变了一切：背叛虽能赚眼前一笔，但会触发对手的报复，葬送未来所有的合谋利润。最简单的报复机制是触发策略——「只要你一直守约我就守约，一旦你背叛我就永远回到竞争价（冷酷触发）」。</p>\n<p>合谋能否维持，取决于贴现因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>（衡量企业多看重未来，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 1 越有耐心）。维持合谋的条件是「守约的长期收益」不低于「背叛一次后被永久惩罚的收益」。以对称两厂、合谋利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^m/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>、背叛即时利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、竞争利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为例，不背叛的条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>δ</mi><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi^m/2}{1-\\delta} \\geq \\pi^d + \\frac{\\delta \\pi^c}{1-\\delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9824em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>整理得临界贴现因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\geq \\dfrac{\\pi^d - \\pi^m/2}{\\pi^d - \\pi^c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2954em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。只要企业足够有耐心（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 够大），合谋就能作为子博弈精炼纳什均衡被维持。这正是无名氏定理（Folk Theorem）的精神：在足够耐心的无限重复博弈中，任何优于一次性纳什均衡的结果（包括合谋的垄断价）都可以被某个均衡支撑。这一逻辑与 <a href=\"../strategy-games/entry-deterrence-commitment\">进入威慑与承诺</a> 中可信威胁的分析一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么让合谋更易或更难维持\">什么让合谋更易或更难维持</h2><p>无名氏定理告诉我们合谋「可能」维持，但现实中卡特尔有的稳如磐石、有的迅速瓦解，差别藏在影响临界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的诸多因素里。理解这些因素既是企业评估合谋可行性的清单，也是反垄断机构识别高危行业的依据。</p>\n<p>有利于合谋的条件：企业数量少（协调和监测都更容易）、产品同质（价格可比，背叛一眼看穿）、需求稳定可预测（异常销量更易归因于背叛而非市场波动）、交易频繁透明（背叛被快速发现、惩罚及时）、存在便于协调的焦点（如行业基准价、成本加成惯例）。不利于合谋的条件则相反：参与者众多、产品复杂难比价、需求剧烈波动（背叛与衰退难以区分）、订单大而稀疏（背叛一笔大单的诱惑极大）、存在搅局的边缘厂商。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>利于合谋</th>\n<th>不利合谋</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>企业数量</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品同质性</td>\n<td>高（易比价监测）</td>\n<td>低（难察背叛）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求稳定性</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>剧烈波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易频率</td>\n<td>高频小额</td>\n<td>低频大额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息透明度</td>\n<td>高（背叛立现）</td>\n<td>低（背叛难查）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意的是，这些「利于合谋」的因素恰恰也是高市场集中、高进入壁垒的特征，这把分析接回了 <a href=\"../market-structure/concentration-entry-barriers\">市场集中度与进入壁垒</a>——结构与行为在此交汇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"显性卡特尔-默契合谋与反垄断对策\">显性卡特尔、默契合谋与反垄断对策</h2><p>合谋有两种形态。显性卡特尔指企业之间有明确的沟通和协议（开会、电话、备忘录约定价格或份额），这在几乎所有法域都是本身违法（per se illegal）的核心卡特尔行为，无须证明效果就构成违法，处罚最重。默契合谋（tacit collusion）则指企业不沟通，仅通过观察彼此行为达成的价格协调——比如人人都跟随龙头涨价。默契合谋虽损害竞争，却因缺乏「协议」证据而极难定罪，是反垄断执法的灰色地带。</p>\n<p>针对显性卡特尔天生的不稳定性，各国祭出了一件利器——宽大处理制度（leniency）：第一个主动向当局坦白并提供证据的卡特尔成员，可获大幅减免甚至豁免处罚。这巧妙地把卡特尔内部的囚徒困境武器化——既然每个成员都担心别人先告密自己被重罚，最优策略反而是抢先自首，于是卡特尔从内部被引爆。欧盟与美国的宽大政策瓦解了大量重大卡特尔，是现代反卡特尔执法最有效的工具之一。完整的执法体系与处罚标准见 <a href=\"../policy-frontiers/antitrust-policy-enforcement\">反垄断政策与执法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合谋让寡头共享垄断利润，但本质是囚徒困境：集体要求维持高价，个体却有背叛降价的占优动机，一次性博弈中必然瓦解。</li>\n<li>无限重复博弈通过触发策略让背叛者承受未来惩罚，合谋可在贴现因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\geq (\\pi^d - \\pi^m/2)/(\\pi^d - \\pi^c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时维持，这是无名氏定理的体现。</li>\n<li>企业少、产品同质、需求稳定、交易频繁透明的市场更易维持合谋，这些也是高集中、高壁垒行业的特征。</li>\n<li>显性卡特尔（有协议）几乎处处本身违法、处罚最重；默契合谋（无沟通的价格协调）损害竞争却极难定罪。</li>\n<li>宽大处理制度把卡特尔内部的囚徒困境武器化，诱使成员抢先自首，是现代反卡特尔执法最有效的工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合谋与卡特尔","id":"合谋与卡特尔"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"合谋的囚徒困境本质","id":"合谋的囚徒困境本质"},{"level":2,"text":"重复博弈与无名氏定理","id":"重复博弈与无名氏定理"},{"level":2,"text":"什么让合谋更易或更难维持","id":"什么让合谋更易或更难维持"},{"level":2,"text":"显性卡特尔、默契合谋与反垄断对策","id":"显性卡特尔-默契合谋与反垄断对策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"产品差异化与广告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/industrial-organization/firm-conduct/product-differentiation-advertising"},"next":{"title":"进入威慑与承诺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/industrial-organization/strategy-games/entry-deterrence-commitment"}}